<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>Zéro n’est pas le but.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Le potentiel est exploré individuellement, non calculé à partir de l’écart.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Satisfaction personnelle : 0 = pas du tout, 10 = entièrement. Échelle non clinique.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Physique</p><h3>Mouvement et confort</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">Actuel</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Non évalué</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">Souhaité</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Non évalué</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potentiel</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non déterminé</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Cognitif</p><h3>Attention</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">Actuel</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value=""