div><span class="pc-state-title">Potentiel</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non déterminé</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Professionnel</p><h3>Ressources au travail</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">Actuel</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Non évalué</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">Souhaité</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Non évalué</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potentiel</span><div class="pc-unknown">Non déterminé</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">Le potentiel est exploré individuellement, non calculé à partir de l’écart.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Réinitialiser</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>Enregistrer sur l’appareil</button></div><p class="pc-note">Aucun transfert automatique ; export JSON local.</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Discuter de votre situation</a></div></section></main>